=== M7 early, interior band width 6 (dec10-matched) ===
selection    interior band width 6 (blocks 2..3)
denoiser      checkpoints/denoiser_dag10_d16_mixedP50.pt  4L x 128w
vae           checkpoints/vae_dag10_d16.pt
condition     --corrupt early   [TARGETED: interior-band]
traces        3000 held-out corrupted pairs, B=10
sampling      nfe 32, eta 1.0, erasure seed 0
selection     ORACLE — the corrupted index is known. Upper bound.

==============================================================================
THE CENTRAL EXPERIMENT
==============================================================================
   condition    exact   RESULT  operands   formed   answer  preserved
        none    21.9%    21.9%     97.7%    99.9%    99.9%      99.3%
      causal     0.1%     0.6%      0.4%    99.7%    99.9%      99.3%
      global     0.0%     1.4%      0.1%    96.6%    99.9%      99.3%

==============================================================================
  GAP (global - causal)   exact -0.1%   RESULT +0.8%   operands -0.3%
==============================================================================
  RESULT is the arm the experiment's logic points at: the corruption
  changes a result, downstream steps consume the original value, so
  downstream context identifies the RESULT and nothing else. Operands
  are fixed by the question, and question conditioning (M5) is not
  built — so a positive RESULT gap with a flat operands gap is exactly
  the signature the claim predicts.
  Positive -> regenerating with downstream context in view repairs
  the corrupted block more reliably than regenerating causally. That
  is the claim the whole repo was built to test.

  Read as an UPPER BOUND: block selection is oracle here.

  `none` IS NOT THE BASELINE FOR THESE ARMS. It measures the VAE
  round-trip, not no-revision: the VAE was trained on valid arithmetic
  only, so it projects an off-distribution corrupted step onto the
  nearest valid one and silently repairs 19.6% of corruptions. The
  regeneration arms erase the block and discard that free repair.
  The reference is CHANCE — see scripts/m7_strata.py, which scores
  every rate against a permutation null.

PAIRED (McNemar) on RESULT: global-only 39, causal-only 16,
  discordant 55, chi2(1) with continuity correction = 8.80
  p < 0.05

wrote 3000 records to runs/dag10_early_band6.json

